  "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Update the machine map for Ariadne's move**\n\nWhen operators follow the checked-in deployment runbook, this new assignment conflicts with `deploy/machines/README.md`, which still lists Ariadne on `mac`, and with `deploy/machines/edge-macbook/README.md`, which still says she lives there and instructs running her live daemon. That leaves the declared ratified topology inconsistent with the subscription and can cause a reprovision or cutover to configure the wrong host; update the machine map and the mac/cx53 seat instructions alongside this change.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
